251
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:18,157
You'll see once we get there.

252
00:18:18,240 --> 00:18:19,700
It's a bit far, though.

253
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:29,977
If you need that much food, you
must have recruited many allies.

254
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:32,660
You're here, aren't you, Keen?

255
00:18:33,180 --> 00:18:35,298
You've returned to the land of Wano.

256
00:18:36,240 --> 00:18:38,820
I was stunned when I saw Kikunojo.

257
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:43,220
Don't worry, Keen.

258
00:18:43,580 --> 00:18:45,060
You can rely on me.

259
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:47,757
I will draw the attention of our enemies.

260
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:49,320
Your secret is safe.

261
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,480
I won't let them find you.

262
00:18:52,620 --> 00:18:54,000
Save this country.

263
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:57,120
Bring back the glory of the Kozuki clan.

264
00:18:58,820 --> 00:18:59,980
Tsuru, stop this!

265
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:02,044
You don't have to cover for us!

266
00:19:02,480 --> 00:19:03,700
It's all right now.

267
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:07,591
All we wanted was to eat our
fill even once before we died.

268
00:19:09,360 --> 00:19:10,190
Huh?

269
00:19:10,273 --> 00:19:12,540
Does that mean you bastards did it?

270
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:21,510
Akazaya!

271
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:25,960
You can all say hello
to your lord in hell!

272
00:19:28,380 --> 00:19:29,840
Did you find the ship?

273
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,510
Yes, sir.

274
00:19:31,593 --> 00:19:32,680
It's in sight right now.

275
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:36,137
You sure you want us to
let loose on this thing?

276
00:19:36,220 --> 00:19:38,480
I told you to do it, so do it already!

277
00:19:42,100 --> 00:19:43,060
Burn it.

278
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:44,690
Roger!

279
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:01,480
Missing complete!

280
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:08,067
You really thought I'd
let you have your way?

281
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:09,960
I am the Shogun!

282
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:11,840
Now the bridges!

283
00:20:14,020 --> 00:20:17,432
The great bridge between Kibi
and Udon has been destroyed!

284
00:20:17,620 --> 00:20:19,040
Don't stop there!

285
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:24,257
The great bridge between Kibi
and Udon has been destroyed!

286
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:26,160
This is what you get!

287
00:20:27,820 --> 00:20:29,173
What the hell happened?

288
00:20:29,260 --> 00:20:30,897
Someone just blew up the bridge!

289
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:32,717
We can't get to the other side.

290
00:20:32,800 --> 00:20:33,757
Something's wrong.

291
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:35,857
The enemy must have discovered our plan.

292
00:20:35,940 --> 00:20:38,300
All that remains is the port.

293
00:20:40,740 --> 00:20:43,877
We destroyed every ship in
the port as you ordered, sir.

294
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:44,790
Excellent.

295
00:20:44,940 --> 00:20:47,469
We'll rebuild everything
once this is over.

296
00:20:47,860 --> 00:20:48,690
Unfortunately,

297
00:20:48,773 --> 00:20:52,477
I've yet to see the Akasaya samurai or
any of the troops they've recruited,

298
00:20:52,560 --> 00:20:54,420
but I know they're out there.

299
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:59,117
The tale of the samurai who
traveled through time from

300
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:03,560
20 years in the past Of course
no one believed that story

301
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:07,853
But perhaps they will when I
show them one of their heads

302
00:21:08,620 --> 00:21:13,080
No, even if I did show them,
it's too strange to believe

303
00:21:13,860 --> 00:21:18,580
Yasui knew exactly what he was doing
He made it sound even more ridiculous

304
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,560
But my information is credible

305
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:27,240
The Akasaya members are indeed alive.

306
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:33,518
I don't care if everyone in this
blasted country thinks I've gone mad!

307
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:36,621
I have the authority to
do as I please either way!

308
00:21:37,740 --> 00:21:43,300
Not only did I destroy their ships, I've
blocked every last route to Kage Port!

309
00:21:43,860 --> 00:21:45,240
4,000 troops?

310
00:21:45,740 --> 00:21:47,420
You did a splendid job!

311
00:21:47,760 --> 00:21:51,525
But not a single one of them is
making it to that port tomorrow!

312
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:55,580
You won't even get a chance
to exact your revenge!

313
00:21:58,300 --> 00:22:01,420
I'll kill you again, ghost of Akazaya!

314
00:22:02,080 --> 00:22:03,340
Follow in despair!

315
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:06,720
See how truly helpless you are!

316
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:16,360
Stop the soundness!

317
00:22:16,540 --> 00:22:18,011
You can't take that boat!

318
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:19,906
All of you will die and save!

319
00:22:21,020 --> 00:22:23,320
We should turn back! We can regroup!

320
00:22:23,700 --> 00:22:25,520
Let's wait for another chance!

321
00:22:25,880 --> 00:22:28,120
We cannot throw away this opportunity.

322
00:22:28,580 --> 00:22:31,874
The chance you speak of will
not occur for another year.

323
00:22:32,820 --> 00:22:35,917
Soon they will discover that
we've taken control of Udon.

324
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:38,077
There will be nowhere left for us to hide.

325
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:38,990
Not anymore.

326
00:22:40,540 --> 00:22:42,597
Kaido will use the full
strength of his army

327
00:22:42,680 --> 00:22:45,327
to hunt down every last
rebel in the country.

328
00:22:46,980 --> 00:22:49,160
We can't keep stealing their food.

329
00:22:49,340 --> 00:22:51,046
They'll catch on soon enough.

330
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:54,969
You heard what happened before
we departed from Kuri, right?

331
00:22:55,860 --> 00:23:01,120
The people of Okobore Town believed in
us and took the blame for our crimes.

332
00:23:01,740 --> 00:23:03,420
They were burned alive.

333
00:23:04,060 --> 00:23:07,280
Among them was my wife.

334
00:23:10,980 --> 00:23:12,600
Please allow us to go.

335
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,080
I will not.

336
00:23:17,260 --> 00:23:18,540
You want us to flee?

337
00:23:18,820 --> 00:23:19,650
Live in disgrace?

338
00:23:19,733 --> 00:23:22,180
You would deny us even our dignity?

339
00:23:23,620 --> 00:23:25,740
But what will become of me?

340
00:23:26,220 --> 00:23:28,360
We want you to live, of course.

341
00:23:29,060 --> 00:23:30,420
Alongside Lady Yuri.

342
00:23:30,660 --> 00:23:33,131
You're saying that you want to abandon me?

343
00:23:34,140 --> 00:23:37,700
Your father began without a
single supporter to his name.

344
00:23:37,980 --> 00:23:41,840
We were lucky, and we are grateful
that we were able to meet him.

345
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:46,697
He took a bunch of fools and turned them
into samurai because he believed in us.

346
00:23:46,780 --> 00:23:50,160
So we are here as retainers to our Lord,

347
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:55,140
and I shall proudly fight in his
name, to the bitter end, if need be.

348
00:23:58,220 --> 00:23:59,050
Don't go!

349
00:23:59,133 --> 00:24:01,580
You can't leave me, Kin'emon! Please!

350
00:24:02,060 --> 00:24:04,960
I can't stand to lose anyone else!

351
00:24:09,020 --> 00:24:10,600
Listen up, all of you.

352
00:24:10,940 --> 00:24:13,397
This country has been
isolated for centuries.

353
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:18,160
As its stewards, it is a decision
deeply tied to the Kozuki clan.

354
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:20,420
But the times are changing.

355
00:24:20,860 --> 00:24:23,120
This world will soon enter a new era.

356
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:28,580
Before this comes to pass, our land
of Wano must be prepared to meet it!

357
00:24:28,780 --> 00:24:30,800
We must open our borders!

358
00:24:52,360 --> 00:24:58,200
The tale of Odin begins 41
years ago in the Flower Capital.

359
00:24:59,900 --> 00:25:02,180
Kozuki Odin has returned!

360
00:25:02,880 --> 00:25:05,704
Hide your wives quickly,
and your daughters too!

361
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:09,207
Hide the livestock quick,
hide the livestock!

362
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:16,077
looks like his latest escape plan must
have failed what is wrong with you don't

363
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:22,860
you ever learn the man was well known
in the capital but not always well liked

364
00:25:34,120 --> 00:25:37,280
Damn it, I can't breathe!
